    "chunk_text": "folces, & sendon Lucius Postumius \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Romane gesetton Claudius Marcellus to consule, se w\u00e6s \u00e6r Scipian gefera. He for dearnenga mid gewealdene fultume on \u00feone ende Hannibales folces \u00fee he self on w\u00e6s, & \u00dea h\u00e6fde Marcellus Romanum cu\u00f0 gedon \u00fe\u00e6t mon Hannibal geflieman mehte, \u00f0eh \u00fee hie \u00e6r Gemong \u00f0\u00e6m gewinnum \u00fea twegen Scipian, \u00fee \u00fea w\u00e6ron consulas & eac gebro\u00f0or, hie w\u00e6ron Se w\u00e6s eac Pena o\u00feer cyning. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Centenus Penula se consul b\u00e6d \u00fe\u00e6tte senatus him fultum sealdon, \u00fe\u00e6t he mehte & \u00fe\u00e6r ofslagen wear\u00f0, & eahta \u00feusend his folces. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Sempronius Craccus se consul for eft mid fierde angean Hannibal, & gefliemed Hu magon nu Romane, cw\u00e6\u00f0 Orosius, to so\u00fee gesecgan \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00fea h\u00e6fden beteran tida \u00feonne hie I w\u00e6s on Ispania; o\u00feer on M\u00e6cedonia; III on Capadotia; IIII \u00e6t ham wi\u00f0 Hannibal: & hie eac Ac \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s swi\u00f0e sweotol \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00fea w\u00e6ron beteran \u00feegnas \u00feonne hie nu sien, \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00feeh \u00fe\u00e6s \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s V hunde wintrum & XLIII, \u00fe\u00e6tte Marcellus Claudius On \u00fe\u00e6m teo\u00fean geare \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee Hannibal won on Italie, he for of Campaina \u00fe\u00e6m londe o\u00fe \u00ferio \u00de\u00e6s on mergen Hannibal gefor to \u00fe\u00e6re byrig, & beforan \u00f0\u00e6m geate his folc getrymede, \u00fee mon",
